230
00:16:34,033 --> 00:16:44,405
vider lign oyf di shtrozn, vider esn roye grozn, gotenyu, du zest dos un du shvaygst

231
00:16:45,424 --> 00:16:47,134
ikh bin a froy

232
00:16:47,134 --> 00:16:54,997
