237
00:17:22,009 --> 00:17:25,195
i di kukle

238
00:17:25,195 --> 00:17:27,752
i dos tepl

239
00:17:27,752 --> 00:17:31,706
i dos letste kleyd

240
00:17:32,151 --> 00:17:34,738
efsher fun di

241
00:17:34,738 --> 00:17:42,880
ale zakhn vel ikh kenen a kopke makhn, oder tsu koyfn gornisht mer.

242
00:17:43,744 --> 00:17:49,150
KUPITI, koyft

243
00:17:49,150 --> 00:17:54,070
zhe, koyft zhe halb umzist

244
00:17:54,223 --> 00:18:01,030
rakhmones oyf dem kind bay mayner brust

245
00:18:01,030 --> 00:18:04,430
hot rakhmones

246
00:18:04,430 --> 00:18:08,440
