288
00:20:42,388 --> 00:20:44,368
DANIEL.

289
00:20:45,606 --> 00:20:49,059
do iz d- kimat di gantse mishpokhe undzere

290
00:20:49,470 --> 00:20:51,641
fun links

291
00:20:52,002 --> 00:20:55,826
oyvn shteyt mayn mame's shvester.

292
00:20:57,823 --> 00:20:59,777
