303
00:21:26,719 --> 00:21:28,041
di mume

304
00:21:29,478 --> 00:21:30,690
Nekhe.

305
00:21:31,050 --> 00:21:33,744
do shteyt oyvn mayn mame.

306
00:21:34,476 --> 00:21:37,423
