358
00:24:09,777 --> 00:24:10,860
di bild?

359
00:24:11,110 --> 00:24:15,154
 di bild, dos iz mayn SON, mayn zun

360
00:24:15,582 --> 00:24:17,975
BENJAMIN EIZENBERG

361
00:24:17,975 --> 00:24:20,756
zayn froy DEBBIE EIZENBERG

362
00:24:20,830 --> 00:24:23,476
un dos iz mayn klenst eynikl.

363
00:24:23,476 --> 00:24:26,662
dos iz geven tsurik mit tsvey monat

364
00:24:26,753 --> 00:24:30,881
dem tsveleftn AUGUST, nayntsn zeks un nayntsik.

365
00:24:31,039 --> 00:24:35,406
zi trogt dem nomen fun mayn shvester LIZA, Leyele.

366
00:24:35,406 --> 00:24:38,883
zi heyst Leyele BENJAMIN EIZENBERG.

